dle-source":{"description":"Native capability routing across library, durable service and process boundaries, with bounded content-addressed bundle decoding and negative parser tests. Existing ServiceExecutorV1 additionally fences unresolved prior dispatches across owner restart and changed plans using the same durable attempt records and directory lock; terminal reconciliation and physical resource settlement remain separate. Paired caches additionally require actual content-verified evidence bound to the exact start request; copied unrelated results, corrupt/missing evidence and self-rehashed malformed identity fields refuse new dispatch. Same-wave request handoffs now revalidate the original live clock/lease; exact regression requirements cover refusal before a second handoff and retained accounting without claiming physical cancellation or atomic process-start authority.","files":[{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/native_business.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"f18552d6e850470f537de15cb7908115cdb12e06","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"function","name":"execute_native_business_for_capability_v1"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/native_business/types.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"085d288177a0ae8179f702dc71a4a6d0f7bb7d1c","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"type","name":"NativeBusinessJobV1"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/worker.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"28bc08b3ce35e5aca9b00af770defdc156290fd6","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"type","name":"ServiceExecutorV1"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/bin/hepta-native-business.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"72eb26ef7312a4fa09e25ba0c63d4a8f9a80ac3a","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"function","name":"run_bytes"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/native_business/build.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"fd3df502af2ba1765ff206a9e4ebefbebf6